{
  "name": "HottyTree",
  "description": "A repository's files. The arrows, j and k move the selection, which is written to /selected; the right arrow and l open a folder, then go into it, the left arrow and h close it, then go up; what is open is written to /expanded. A click selects a node and opens or closes a folder. Typing in Filter shows the files whose names hold its characters, in order, with the folders they're in, every folder open. Enter, or a second click on the selected file, sends openFile with it; Enter on a folder opens or closes it. Twelve rows show at a time.",
